ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more than 100 collectible items earned through in-game challenges ranging from easy to legendary difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512590/extras/bf0d13cffe6b57a828a40e555499e1a7.poster.avif?t=1767918841\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512590/extras/bf0d13cffe6b57a828a40e555499e1a7.webm?t=1767918841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512590/extras/bf0d13cffe6b57a828a40e555499e1a7.mp4?t=1767918841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is This Game For YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch A Bunch is focused on learning the game mechanics to improve <strong>your skills </strong>through trial, error and lots of practice. The controls are uniquely designed and button mashing won't help you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most fighters start off rough, this game is designed to give you great satisfaction through honing your skills and mastering the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512590/extras/17c2a589404c2565618c2aafac5e520b.webp?t=1767918841\" width=630 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>YES </strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique controls giving you full control but takes practice to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick tutorial to get you started on your boxing journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% physics-based.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of additional 